      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Emotionally Invested",
      "category": "interaction",
      "traits": [
        "emotion",
        "healing",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "When the therapeutic healer casts a spell with the healing trait on a creature other than themself, the healer regains HP equal to the spell's rank."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Therapeutic Care",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "When Treating Wounds, the therapeutic healer can treat up to four targets. If they succeed at a DC 20 check to Treat Wounds, they can also reduce the value of one Clumsy, Enfeebled, or Stupefied condition affecting a single patient by 1. They can reduce a Drained or Doomed condition instead if they succeed at a DC 30 check. This can't reduce permanent doomed conditions."
    },
